#: crates/sumi-gui/qml/AiVisualPanel.qml:90
msgid ""
"AI Visual looks at what's on this monitor about once a second to pick a "
"GameVisual mode. The picture stays in memory on this PC; nothing is saved or "
"sent anywhere."
msgstr ""
"AI Visual otprilike jednom u sekundi pogleda što se prikazuje na ovom "
"monitoru i odabire način rada GameVisual. Slika ostaje u memoriji ovog "
"računala; ništa se ne sprema niti šalje."

