"ViT-B/32, MIT licence). It is checked against its published SHA-256 and kept "
"in ~/.local/share/sumi/models."
msgstr ""
"Preuzeti AI Visual model? %1, %2 MB, s huggingface.co (OpenAI CLIP ViT-B/32, "
"MIT licenca). Provjerava se prema objavljenom SHA-256 sažetku i sprema u "
"~/.local/share/sumi/models."

